step 22 "@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!"
pulses 35
out god "\n\rRambler's slash misses the duck.\n\rThe duck's peck misses Rambler.\n\rDecimus's slash scratches the drunk.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rRambler's slash misses the duck.\n\rThe duck's peck misses Rambler.\n\rThe drunk's beating scratches Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slash grazes the drunk.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rRambler's slash misses the duck.\n\rThe duck's peck misses Rambler.\n\rThe drunk's beating misses Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slash scratches the drunk.\n\rThe drunk is DEAD!!\n\rThe drunk hits the ground ... DEAD.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
out dec "\n\rRambler's slash misses the duck.\n\rThe duck's peck misses Rambler.\n\rYou dodge the drunk's attack.\n\rYour slash scratches the drunk.\n\rThe drunk has some big nasty wounds and scratches. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rRambler's slash misses the duck.\n\rThe duck's peck misses Rambler.\n\rThe drunk's beating scratches you.\n\rYour slash grazes the drunk.\n\rThe drunk looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<28hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rRambler's slash misses the duck.\n\rThe duck's peck misses Rambler.\n\rThe drunk's beating misses you.\n\rYour slash scratches the drunk.\n\rThe drunk is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 0 experience points.\n\rThe drunk hits the ground ... DEAD.\n\r\n\r<28hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
out ram "\n\rYour slash misses the duck.\n\rThe duck's peck misses you.\n\rDecimus's slash scratches the drunk.\n\rThe duck looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYour slash misses the duck.\n\rThe duck's peck misses you.\n\rThe drunk's beating scratches Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slash grazes the drunk.\n\rThe duck looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rYour slash misses the duck.\n\rThe duck's peck misses you.\n\rThe drunk's beating misses Decimus.\n\rDecimus's slash scratches the drunk.\n\rThe drunk is DEAD!!\n\rThe drunk hits the ground ... DEAD.\n\rThe duck looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
